<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
believe that there is a strong market demand for sports bicycles and electric bicycles in the global market. According to the industry
report prepared by Frost &amp; Sullivan, such increasing trend on the demand for bicycle products is mainly attributable to the change
in people&#8217;s habits toward pursuing a healthier lifestyle and the implementation of government policies on supporting environmentally
friendly transportation or vehicles. In light of the increasing market demand for bicycle products, in the future, we will focus on sales
of bicycle products and continue to enhance the quality and modify the design of our sports bicycle and electric bicycle products.</span></p>

