mortgage its undertaking, property and uncalled capital, and issue debentures or other securities whenever money is borrowed or as security
for any obligation of the company or of any third party.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

