                                            $<span id="xdx_907_eifrs-full--ProceedsFromBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities_pn5n6_c20260329__20260331__ifrs-full--CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis__custom--MsYuNingChiangMember_zHRngAAgoFLk" title="Advances from additional loans"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" contextRef="From2026-03-292026-03-31_custom_MsYuNingChiangMember" id="Fact000800" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span> million subsequent to year end up to March 31, 2026.</span></td></tr>
<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
